WEBVTT

00:02.600 --> 00:04.970
It's already December...

00:04.970 --> 00:07.390
The year really flew by.

00:07.390 --> 00:08.990
It did.

00:09.630 --> 00:10.770
But...

00:11.070 --> 00:13.970
Christmas is in December!

00:13.970 --> 00:16.280
Merry Christmas!

00:16.280 --> 00:17.680
Isn't it kinda early...?

00:17.680 --> 00:20.780
What presents should I get everyone?

00:20.780 --> 00:23.290
I'll handle the drinks and cake!

00:24.140 --> 00:26.820
<i>She really does love these kinds events.</i>

00:27.280 --> 00:31.290
I'm curious, Shinozaki-san, do you 
have any plans for Christmas Day?

00:32.180 --> 00:33.790
Not really...

00:33.790 --> 00:36.430
It's a weekday this year, 
so I'll probably just be working.

00:36.810 --> 00:38.190
I see.

00:38.800 --> 00:40.740
<i>I might not have plans, but...</i>

00:40.740 --> 00:44.280
<i>if I come to work, I'll get to see 
Senpai, so I won't be lonely.</i>

00:46.960 --> 00:49.590
Since her kohai is going to be 
working hard on Christmas Day,

00:49.590 --> 00:53.070
Santa Senpai is going to have 
something special for him!

00:53.070 --> 00:55.940
Make sure to be a good boy until then!

00:56.260 --> 00:57.260
<i>Huh?</i>

00:56.260 --> 00:59.940
Ho, ho, ho... Ho, ho, ho...

01:02.700 --> 01:04.840
I'm sorry! I don't know why, but I'm sorry!

01:05.110 --> 01:07.240
N-No, it's not like that!

01:07.970 --> 01:10.950
<i>She was so cute my mind completely froze up!</i>

01:10.950 --> 01:14.350
I'm so sorry... a-and embarrassed...

01:15.860 --> 01:18.720
N-No, I should be a-apologizing!

01:21.710 --> 01:22.790
Glance...

01:22.790 --> 01:24.180
Will there be a Santa Hayakawa...?

01:24.180 --> 01:25.970
There will not.

01:37.950 --> 01:42.710
My Tiny Senpai

01:43.460 --> 01:45.790
<i>We've got an emergency here</i>

01:46.210 --> 01:48.570
<i>Are you paying attention, me?</i>

01:48.960 --> 01:54.800
<i>There's someone other than me 
dancing around inside of my heart</i>

01:54.800 --> 01:57.050
<i>I want to talk to her</i>

01:57.560 --> 02:00.100
<i>I want to touch her</i>

02:00.100 --> 02:05.590
<i>Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down</i>

02:06.110 --> 02:08.820
<i>What in the world am I doing?</i>

02:08.820 --> 02:11.570
<i>You're right next to me</i>

02:11.570 --> 02:17.820
<i>And this is the perfect chance...</i>

02:18.580 --> 02:19.400
<i>HONEY</i>

02:19.400 --> 02:24.110
<i>I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste</i>

02:24.110 --> 02:27.320
<i>And I don't think I can ever escape</i>

02:27.320 --> 02:29.820
<i>I may as well just sink into it</i>

02:29.820 --> 02:30.630
<i>HONEY</i>

02:30.630 --> 02:35.430
<i>It's another day in your dazzling presence</i>

02:35.640 --> 02:38.430
<i>We may never be 
on the same page with this love but</i>

02:38.430 --> 02:44.860
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

02:56.730 --> 03:01.240
#05 Shall We Go Somewhere Before Heading Home?

02:57.180 --> 03:02.950
And that covers our company's project 
proposal regarding the Meowtaro collaboration.

03:03.380 --> 03:05.890
Did you have any questions?

03:05.890 --> 03:09.960
No, that made a lot of 
sense. Thank you so much.

03:10.290 --> 03:14.040
In that case, Shinozaki will contact you

03:14.040 --> 03:17.360
in regards to nailing down the scheduling.

03:17.360 --> 03:19.380
I-I'll be in touch.

03:19.380 --> 03:21.460
Right, I'll be waiting to hear from you.

03:23.660 --> 03:26.980
I'm still not used to meeting with clients...

03:27.760 --> 03:29.050
I know what you mean.

03:29.050 --> 03:32.470
It's a different kind of tension 
from having a meeting at the office.

03:33.010 --> 03:37.500
Still, you were very well-spoken 
today, Shinozaki-san.

03:37.500 --> 03:39.220
Th-Thank you.

03:42.370 --> 03:44.660
Look, Shinozaki-san!

03:44.660 --> 03:47.370
Isn't that loungewear adorable?

03:47.800 --> 03:49.620
It is.

03:50.030 --> 03:51.760
<i>Bunny ears, huh...?</i>

03:54.610 --> 03:58.330
What do you think? 
I'm your bunny-eared senpai!

03:59.320 --> 04:02.490
<i>It'd definitely be cute if she wore it...</i>

04:03.490 --> 04:06.620
I think it'd look great 
on you, Shinozaki-san.

04:06.620 --> 04:07.660
On me?!

04:07.660 --> 04:09.740
What makes you say that?

04:09.740 --> 04:11.020
I mean...

04:11.720 --> 04:14.270
Look at the bear-ear hood.

04:14.930 --> 04:18.970
It's just like that stuffed 
animal we won at the arcade.

04:21.650 --> 04:25.610
<i>Wait, w-why am I trying to 
make them look alike?!</i>

04:25.610 --> 04:30.210
In that case, wouldn't this 
Shiori-san-looking bunny one be for you?

04:31.060 --> 04:33.240
M-Me and Shiori-san...?

04:36.620 --> 04:37.930
Got you!

04:38.880 --> 04:40.370
Buck buck-kaw.

04:42.130 --> 04:45.290
No, no, no, no! Th-That's a terrible idea!

04:45.290 --> 04:46.270
That bad?!

04:46.490 --> 04:48.910
I don't want to be a 
sexually harassing senpai!

04:48.910 --> 04:50.520
From putting on bunny ears?!

04:50.790 --> 04:54.490
M-My point is, me wearing 
this would be a bit...

04:54.490 --> 04:55.770
It's the same for me.

04:56.970 --> 04:57.980
<i>But...</i>

04:58.680 --> 05:00.670
<i>If Senpai put it on...</i>

05:01.620 --> 05:04.290
<i>If Shinozaki-san put it on...</i>

05:05.180 --> 05:07.290
<i>It'd definitely be cute.</i>

05:12.800 --> 05:14.630
<i>I wanna see that!</i>

05:15.280 --> 05:17.220
Excuse me!

05:17.660 --> 05:20.420
Right there! That lovely couple!

05:21.910 --> 05:24.130
Pardon the interruption.

05:24.130 --> 05:27.880
I'm a Nya~Tuber, 
and I've been trying to hear

05:27.880 --> 05:30.450
lovey-dovey stories from couples about town.

05:30.890 --> 05:32.920
May I borrow some of your time?

05:34.600 --> 05:36.210
We're...

05:36.210 --> 05:38.080
not a couple.

05:39.970 --> 05:44.440
I can't believe that, after ten attempts, 
I've still come up empty-handed...

05:44.810 --> 05:48.330
Why can't I find a couple?!

05:48.330 --> 05:51.450
I-I'm not sure why, but I'm sorry.

05:51.450 --> 05:54.410
I was so sure they were a couple!

05:54.410 --> 05:58.260
If you're not going out, 
what's your relationship?

05:58.260 --> 05:59.700
We're coworkers.

06:00.440 --> 06:01.970
Coworkers...

06:01.970 --> 06:04.960
Right, at the same company.

06:06.580 --> 06:10.060
Could one of you confess your feelings
right now so you can become involved?

06:10.060 --> 06:11.580
No!

06:11.890 --> 06:15.070
Why not?! Please, start dating!

06:15.070 --> 06:16.470
Wha?! Let go!

06:16.470 --> 06:19.900
No! Not until the two of you are a couple!

06:19.900 --> 06:22.400
I'm begging you! We're at our wits' end!

06:22.400 --> 06:24.540
C-Cut it out! We can't!

06:24.540 --> 06:27.480
Please let go! You're going to 
give people the wrong idea!

06:27.480 --> 06:29.780
Please! It's just for the Internet!

06:29.780 --> 06:33.720
We've got next to no subscribers! 
We barely get any views anyway!

06:33.720 --> 06:35.620
Doesn't it hurt you to say that?!

06:37.370 --> 06:38.980
I guess we don't have a choice.

06:38.980 --> 06:41.270
Just for a little while, okay?

06:41.830 --> 06:43.080
S-Senpai?!

06:43.080 --> 06:45.820
And we're only going to be pretending.

06:45.820 --> 06:51.590
Thank you so much! Thank you 
so, so much! Thank you!

06:48.850 --> 06:51.880
Pretending to be dating... Senpai...

06:52.670 --> 06:55.380
Okay, right where you are, please.

06:55.820 --> 06:59.240
<i>Pretending to be going out... 
Senpai's so mature.</i>

06:59.240 --> 07:01.330
<i>I must be the only one freaking out...</i>

07:02.880 --> 07:08.840
<i>I thought that agreeing to this would be 
easier than getting her to give up, but...</i>

07:09.410 --> 07:12.890
<i>Wh-What do couples even do?!</i>

07:12.410 --> 07:14.160
m 0 0 l 225 0 l 225 84 l 0 84

07:12.410 --> 07:14.160
<b>Never had a
boyfriend</b>

07:15.130 --> 07:19.870
<i>If we're a couple, that would mean that 
I'm Shinozaki-san's girlfriend...</i>

07:19.410 --> 07:25.290
m 0 0 l 175 0 l 175 84 l 0 84

07:19.410 --> 07:25.290
<b>Never had a
boyfriend</b>

07:19.410 --> 07:25.290
m 0 0 l 122 0 l 122 44 l 0 44

07:19.410 --> 07:25.290
<b>Confused</b>

07:19.870 --> 07:23.860
In other words, Shinozaki-san 
is my boyfriend...

07:25.280 --> 07:29.180
And here we are! 
Let's start with the girlfriend.

07:29.180 --> 07:30.770
S-Sure!

07:30.770 --> 07:33.220
Tell us what you like about your boyfriend.

07:33.640 --> 07:35.480
What I like...?

07:36.130 --> 07:39.490
<i>This is kinda embarrassing, 
but I can take it...</i>

07:40.770 --> 07:45.440
I like how serious he is, and how he really 
throws himself into the tasks he's given.

07:46.540 --> 07:48.640
That sounds lovely!

07:48.640 --> 07:51.030
You two met on the job?

07:51.030 --> 07:51.970
Yes.

07:51.970 --> 07:55.120
So, you must've gotten to know 
each other while working.

07:55.120 --> 07:56.320
That's right.

07:57.030 --> 07:59.410
<i>This doesn't seem so hard, after all.</i>

07:59.410 --> 08:02.090
Now, next, let's see...

08:02.420 --> 08:04.950
What was your first kiss like? And where?

08:04.950 --> 08:07.230
Hold on a second!

08:07.460 --> 08:10.520
Isn't that raising the 
bar a little suddenly?!

08:10.520 --> 08:12.410
Huh? You think?

08:12.410 --> 08:16.960
We're only pretending to be a couple, 
so questions that are too probing might be...

08:17.220 --> 08:22.330
Now, now, just imagine what 
you wish it'd be like!

08:23.120 --> 08:25.150
Please? Please? Please...?

08:25.150 --> 08:27.220
W-Well, in that case...

08:29.020 --> 08:33.230
It was in the office kitchenette... 
when we were alone...

08:33.230 --> 08:34.940
<i>The k-kitchenette?!</i>

08:34.940 --> 08:37.990
<i>I won't be able to keep me cool 
next time I'm in there!!</i>

08:38.280 --> 08:42.760
<i>I-I can't believe I said that! 
It makes it sound like I'm setting him up!</i>

08:43.100 --> 08:45.300
Okay, here's a question for the boyfriend.

08:46.960 --> 08:49.630
<i>I have to make sure I keep 
Senpai's premise going!</i>

08:50.010 --> 08:53.620
<i>But with my experience, there's gonna be 
questions I have no idea how to deal with,</i>

08:53.620 --> 08:55.180
<i>on top of being embarrassed...</i>

08:53.630 --> 08:57.390
m 0 0 l 225 0 l 225 84 l 0 84

08:53.630 --> 08:57.390
<b>Never had a
girlfriend</b>

08:55.180 --> 08:56.900
<i>What do I do?!</i>

08:58.860 --> 09:00.080
<i>I know!</i>

09:00.080 --> 09:02.340
<i>What I learned at the new employee seminar!</i>

09:02.340 --> 09:05.890
<i>When you need to be flexible in your 
thinking, pretend to be someone else!</i>

09:06.320 --> 09:07.710
<i>I'll be a playboy!</i>

09:07.710 --> 09:10.960
<i>If I'm pretending to be a 
player instead of myself,</i>

09:10.960 --> 09:13.820
<i>I should be able to respond to 
anything without freaking out!</i>

09:14.210 --> 09:17.150
Sup! Hell yeah, I get around! How <i>you</i> doing?

09:17.540 --> 09:20.340
Let's start by hearing what you 
like about your girlfriend.

09:20.340 --> 09:25.180
You wanna know about my current 
squeeze? Let me think...

09:25.080 --> 09:27.580
<b>Possessed</b>

09:25.980 --> 09:27.590
Sh-Shinozaki-san?!

09:29.310 --> 09:31.440
Even being around her is awesome, y'know?

09:31.440 --> 09:34.080
It's, like, a miracle we 
hooked up, or something.

09:34.380 --> 09:36.850
<i>Sh-Sh-Sh-Shinozaki-san?!</i>

09:38.320 --> 09:42.240
She's like a ninja with work time, too.

09:42.240 --> 09:45.860
The goddess who taught me there's something 
sweeter than that OT pay, y'know?

09:42.890 --> 09:45.850
m 0 0 l 510 0 l 510 25 l 0 25

09:42.890 --> 09:45.850
<i><b>Possessed, but still Shinozaki Inside</b></i>

09:47.060 --> 09:49.180
<i>H-He's hugging me!</i>

09:49.180 --> 09:53.970
<i>I guess... this is what Shinozaki-san 
would do with his girlfriend.</i>

09:53.970 --> 09:56.990
So, what was your first time together like?

09:57.290 --> 09:58.240
F-First—?!

09:58.530 --> 10:01.000
It was the second time she came by my place.

10:01.810 --> 10:03.990
<i>Th-The second—?!</i>

10:04.250 --> 10:07.410
<i>The first time would probably be 
too much, even for a playboy...</i>

10:07.410 --> 10:12.180
<i>The second time? I've been to 
Shinozaki-san's house once before...</i>

10:12.180 --> 10:15.500
<i>D-Does that mean if I go again...</i>

10:16.250 --> 10:19.760
Shinozaki-san, you left 
something at the office.

10:20.680 --> 10:23.480
You came by a second time...

10:24.670 --> 10:27.030
Do you know what that means, Senpai?

10:27.030 --> 10:29.050
Sh-Shinozaki-san...

10:29.390 --> 10:33.170
<i>W-We can't! It's still too soon!</i>

10:32.900 --> 10:35.150
<b>She forgot the basic premise
was pretending to be dating
in the first place.</b>

10:36.410 --> 10:40.440
<i>For him to be able to say something 
like this without hesitation...</i>

10:40.440 --> 10:42.410
<i>It's so shameless.</i>

10:49.810 --> 10:54.670
I like how serious he is, and how he really 
throws himself into the tasks he's given.

10:55.110 --> 10:58.160
<i>Oh, I see now...</i>

10:58.590 --> 11:05.440
<i>He's throwing himself into answering this 
interview as seriously as possible.</i>

11:05.710 --> 11:07.800
<i>Shinozaki-san, you truly are...</i>

11:08.440 --> 11:11.190
<i>a kohai I can be proud of.</i>

11:12.440 --> 11:14.310
Let's end with a kiss!

11:14.560 --> 11:19.700
Uh, s-sure, piece of cake...

11:20.250 --> 11:22.120
<i>Crap, what now?!</i>

11:22.360 --> 11:24.100
<i>In that case...</i>

11:29.950 --> 11:34.010
<i>In that case, as his senpai, 
I need to support him.</i>

11:34.880 --> 11:36.500
Shinozaki-san...

11:37.200 --> 11:39.670
Don't push yourself too hard, okay?

11:40.850 --> 11:42.640
O-Okay.

11:44.460 --> 11:46.270
Does that work?

11:46.270 --> 11:50.160
Perfect! Thank you so much for this!

11:50.160 --> 11:54.030
Are these two seriously not dating...?

12:01.960 --> 12:03.410
Time for a break...

12:05.270 --> 12:07.780
Wonder if there're any interesting videos up.

12:10.910 --> 12:13.920
Recommended Popular Videos

12:10.910 --> 12:13.920
Colleagues! The Couple Next Door!

12:11.230 --> 12:12.850
What the heck?!

12:16.490 --> 12:19.180
<i>They said they didn't have 
a lot of subscribers...</i>

12:19.180 --> 12:22.680
<i>And that they never got many views...</i>

12:22.680 --> 12:24.360
<i>That's what they said...</i>

12:25.220 --> 12:27.420
Hey, I saw the video!

12:27.420 --> 12:30.150
You two are already going out, huh?

12:30.150 --> 12:31.940
We are not!

12:31.940 --> 12:35.780
Here's hot coffee, 
and a warm senpai's cheek.

12:35.780 --> 12:37.570
I-It really is warm!

12:38.610 --> 12:41.540
<i>My Tiny Senpai</i>.

12:45.850 --> 12:46.910
Everyone!

12:47.300 --> 12:49.900
You've all worked hard again this year.

12:50.510 --> 12:53.570
I want you all to enjoy yourselves.

12:53.570 --> 12:55.750
After all, it's Christmas!

12:55.750 --> 13:00.180
Let's drink to our future success, 
and to Santa's generosity!

13:00.590 --> 13:02.410
Merry Christmas!

13:02.630 --> 13:03.910
Cheers!

13:03.910 --> 13:05.300
Cheers!

13:08.300 --> 13:10.800
Oh, Shinozaki-kun, 
you're such a Shinozaki-kun....

13:10.800 --> 13:11.940
Is it true?

13:11.940 --> 13:13.320
Of course not!

13:18.060 --> 13:19.050
Senpai!

13:20.300 --> 13:22.020
Are you heading home?

13:22.020 --> 13:25.310
I am, too, so why don't we walk 
to the station together?

13:26.910 --> 13:27.900
Sure.

13:32.840 --> 13:35.500
The party was a lot of fun.

13:35.500 --> 13:38.190
The food was delicious, too.

13:38.190 --> 13:38.830
And then...

13:39.430 --> 13:41.060
I'm Santa! Ho, ho, ho!

13:42.260 --> 13:44.800
We got to see a rare managerial Santa.

13:44.800 --> 13:47.330
He was really enjoying himself!

13:48.150 --> 13:50.090
<i>Maybe Senpai will dress 
like Santa next year...</i>

13:50.880 --> 13:52.870
Merry Christmas!

13:54.990 --> 13:56.100
<i>Glorious...</i>

13:56.330 --> 13:59.510
The whole city's really 
in Christmas mode, huh?

13:59.510 --> 14:01.060
S-Sure is.

14:01.060 --> 14:03.530
Shinozaki-san, do you have any plans?

14:03.530 --> 14:05.020
Not really.

14:06.430 --> 14:07.370
In that case...

14:07.920 --> 14:11.460
since it's a special occasion, shall we 
go somewhere before heading home?

14:15.360 --> 14:16.270
Yeah.

14:17.340 --> 14:19.210
What do you think, Shinozaki-san?

14:20.200 --> 14:22.290
Let's head there next!

14:22.290 --> 14:22.880
Sure!

14:23.240 --> 14:24.340
It's so soothing...

14:24.340 --> 14:26.000
Incredibly cute.

14:28.570 --> 14:32.010
Wh-Whoa... Incredible.

14:32.010 --> 14:33.580
It's so beautiful.

14:35.690 --> 14:37.940
This tree's famous, apparently...

14:37.940 --> 14:43.410
I've been meaning to visit it for a while, 
but the chance never really came up.

14:45.560 --> 14:49.900
I'm glad we got to see it 
together, Shinozaki-san.

14:52.890 --> 14:53.910
Me, too.

14:54.680 --> 14:59.580
I'm really happy to spend Christmas 
with you like this, Senpai.

15:03.160 --> 15:05.300
<i>S-So embarrassing...</i>

15:05.300 --> 15:09.160
Wh-Where do you suppose Santa 
is flying right about now?

15:09.160 --> 15:13.820
It must be really hard delivering presents 
to kids around the world in one night.

15:13.820 --> 15:15.360
True enough...

15:15.960 --> 15:21.550
Are there any presents you got from 
Santa that you remember, Shinozaki-san?

15:21.840 --> 15:23.030
Presents...

15:23.390 --> 15:27.310
Let me think... There was 
a video game I wanted once,

15:28.040 --> 15:30.850
but then I got the wrong one.

15:31.180 --> 15:35.360
But since it was from Santa, 
I tried to enjoy it...

15:35.950 --> 15:39.870
and by the time I was done, 
it had really grown on me.

15:41.470 --> 15:45.330
You were a sweetheart when 
you were little, too, I see.

15:45.330 --> 15:47.550
Y-You think...?

15:47.550 --> 15:50.240
What about you, Senpai?

15:50.240 --> 15:51.850
Let me think...

15:52.650 --> 15:58.730
One time, I got this cute stuffed cat, 
and I wanted to have it with me all the time.

15:59.250 --> 16:04.140
I ended up taking it to kindergarten, 
and my parents received a call about it.

16:06.050 --> 16:07.980
That's adorable.

16:07.980 --> 16:09.730
And definitely sounds like you.

16:10.480 --> 16:14.880
I guess we haven't changed 
much since we were little.

16:21.930 --> 16:25.120
I guess staying out for so long, 
it was bound to get cold.

16:26.370 --> 16:28.880
<i>Senpai! She doesn't have gloves!</i>

16:29.290 --> 16:33.120
<i>Maybe I should subtly guide 
her hands into my pockets...?</i>

16:33.720 --> 16:36.640
What a good kohai you are! It's so warm!

16:37.130 --> 16:41.420
<i>That might be kinda rude, though, 
so I should ask first...</i>

16:41.420 --> 16:43.160
Uh, Senpai...

16:44.510 --> 16:46.300
<i>She had gloves!</i>

16:47.160 --> 16:48.520
What's wrong?

16:48.820 --> 16:52.700
Uh, well... nothing, really.

16:53.110 --> 16:57.160
Huh? Shinozaki-san, 
do you not have any gloves?

16:57.160 --> 16:58.950
Oh, no.

16:58.950 --> 17:02.120
But I'll be okay with 
my hands in my pockets.

17:02.120 --> 17:05.670
That's no good! I've got extras, so here...

17:06.910 --> 17:08.540
Yeah, that makes sense.

17:10.420 --> 17:13.980
I'm so sorry! I'll make sure 
to have some ready next year.

17:13.980 --> 17:17.460
No, I should probably just 
get some of my own...

17:17.820 --> 17:20.920
<i>She just casually made a 
promise for next year.</i>

17:20.920 --> 17:23.570
Ugh, look at this.

17:23.570 --> 17:25.450
Just like I figured, 
we came at the worst time.

17:25.450 --> 17:28.310
Tell me about it. 
Couples, as far as the eye can see!

17:28.310 --> 17:30.250
What a drag...

17:30.870 --> 17:33.020
Will springtime ever come for us?

17:33.020 --> 17:36.710
I bet everyone here is gonna 
have a great time later on.

17:37.660 --> 17:40.410
Um, perhaps we should head on home?

17:40.410 --> 17:42.450
G-Good idea.

17:42.740 --> 17:45.200
Oh, but first...

17:45.860 --> 17:46.730
Here.

17:47.070 --> 17:48.700
The bear loungewear?

17:48.700 --> 17:52.970
When we were heading back from that meeting, 
we both thought they looked nice, right?

17:52.970 --> 17:55.700
It's a Christmas present from your senpai.

17:56.220 --> 17:57.960
Do you like it?

17:57.960 --> 18:00.840
I-I do! Thank you!

18:00.840 --> 18:02.210
And to be honest...

18:03.340 --> 18:05.680
It's the rabbit one, from the same time.

18:08.070 --> 18:09.860
Thank you so much!

18:10.330 --> 18:12.870
I guess we were thinking the same thing...

18:13.740 --> 18:16.620
Something about that makes me happy.

18:16.620 --> 18:22.120
I thought you would look good 
in it, and how I'd like to see that...

18:25.260 --> 18:28.750
W-Well, since we traded 
presents, let's hurry home!

18:30.300 --> 18:31.250
We could...

18:34.270 --> 18:37.300
We could... show each other...

18:37.530 --> 18:39.520
Wait... you mean...

18:40.180 --> 18:41.310
that...

18:51.470 --> 18:53.950
Can't believe I left the flash on!

18:53.950 --> 18:55.580
I'll regret this until the day I die.

18:55.580 --> 18:56.980
Seriously!

18:56.980 --> 18:57.970
Manager?!

18:57.970 --> 18:59.490
Hayakawa-san, too?!

18:59.820 --> 19:03.230
Unbelievable! How long have 
you two been watching?!

19:04.080 --> 19:06.350
Well, it was very sweet!

19:06.350 --> 19:09.700
Sweeter than any Christmas 
or fruitcake I've ever had!

19:09.700 --> 19:14.760
I have to say, Katase-san, you're bolder
 than I figured. I'm surprised.

19:15.920 --> 19:20.790
I mean, considering you discussing showing 
each other loungewear on Christmas Day...

19:24.680 --> 19:30.030
N-N-No! Not that! I thought we could send 
each other pictures of us wearing them!

19:30.030 --> 19:33.590
And then... uh... well...

19:34.600 --> 19:39.030
We could... exchange contact info, maybe...

19:42.040 --> 19:44.460
Oh, right! Let's do that!

19:44.460 --> 19:45.780
Exchange contact info!

19:46.070 --> 19:48.150
Th-Thank you...

19:48.150 --> 19:49.000
R-Right!

19:49.500 --> 19:50.970
You, too, Hayakawa-san.

19:50.970 --> 19:53.050
Uh, err, I'm good.

19:56.760 --> 19:59.040
O-Okay, fine!

20:00.170 --> 20:00.800
There.

20:00.800 --> 20:02.420
Thank you, Hayakawa-san!

20:04.710 --> 20:05.960
It's snowing.

20:07.600 --> 20:11.110
It's a white Christmas. How romantic.

20:11.110 --> 20:12.080
Yeah.

20:12.080 --> 20:13.950
Almost seems too convenient.

20:13.950 --> 20:17.850
Let's chalk it up to God bestowing a 
blessing on hard-working people.

20:19.060 --> 20:20.710
That sounds right!

20:21.490 --> 20:23.410
Do you think the 
snow will pile up?

20:23.410 --> 20:25.180
That'd be nice.

20:25.180 --> 20:27.480
And then we can all 
make a snowman together!

20:28.130 --> 20:29.450
I like that idea!

20:29.450 --> 20:30.060
I dunno...

20:30.060 --> 20:31.670
What kind of ears would 
you want, Hayakawa-san?

20:31.670 --> 20:33.240
Why are we talking about ears?

20:43.920 --> 20:44.850
Okay!

20:53.270 --> 20:55.140
<i>So short...</i>

20:55.140 --> 20:58.440
<i>Maybe I'm a little too old 
for this kind of thing?</i>

20:59.760 --> 21:03.150
<i>But it's loungewear, so... 
it's probably fine.</i>

21:03.150 --> 21:05.410
<i>Besides, it was a gift!</i>

21:10.480 --> 21:12.400
How's it look?

21:13.360 --> 21:17.430
I shouldn't expect an 
answer from a plushie...

21:20.750 --> 21:23.670
But, I think... Shinozaki-san...

21:28.800 --> 21:30.650
Thank you.

21:46.220 --> 21:50.100
<i>Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream</i>

21:50.100 --> 21:55.000
<i>I still can't bring myself 
to drink that bitter coffee</i>

21:55.560 --> 21:59.480
<i>So I sneakily toss in 
two pinches of a sweet secret</i>

21:59.480 --> 22:03.700
<i>And let it slowly spread throughout</i>

22:04.920 --> 22:08.660
<i>There's a local bakery 
that's only open sometimes</i>

22:08.660 --> 22:13.550
<i>Where I once had some toast that glittered</i>

22:14.210 --> 22:18.050
<i>What is it that makes it so satisfying?</i>

22:18.050 --> 22:22.220
<i>Almost like magic</i>

22:22.640 --> 22:27.300
<i>I find myself thinking about that kind of thing</i>

22:27.300 --> 22:32.990
<i>How the small things can be the most precious</i>

22:33.750 --> 22:37.700
<i>Deep inside my heart</i>

22:37.700 --> 22:42.100
<i>It's ever so bittersweet</i>

22:42.970 --> 22:47.090
<i>"Just being around you is enough"</i>

22:47.090 --> 22:51.040
<i>Becomes my mantra</i>

22:51.040 --> 22:53.330
<i>Baby like sugar</i>

23:00.520 --> 23:02.660
<i>Baby you're the sugar</i>
